  "notes": "{露出|ろしゅつ} has several meanings related to exposure or revealing.\n\nPHOTOGRAPHY:\n- {露出|ろしゅつ}{補正|ほせい}: exposure compensation\n- {露出|ろしゅつ}{計|けい}: light meter\n- {適正|てきせい}{露出|ろしゅつ}: correct exposure\n- {露出|ろしゅつ}{不足|ぶそく}: underexposure\n- {露出|ろしゅつ}{過多|かた}: overexposure\n\nMEDIA/FASHION:\n- {露出|ろしゅつ}が{多|おお}い: revealing (clothing)\n- メディア{露出|ろしゅつ}: media exposure\n\nVERBAL FORM:\n{露出|ろしゅつ}する: to expose, to be exposed",
